# Boostora — Environment Variables
# Add these in Vercel Dashboard → Project → Settings → Environment Variables

# Your Groq API key (get from console.groq.com)
GROQ_KEY=gsk_your_groq_key_here

# Your Google PageSpeed Insights API key (get from console.cloud.google.com)
PSI_KEY=AIzaSy_your_pagespeed_key_here
